       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 2550 mg three times daily comes to 7,650 mg/day. That is three times the maximum recommended metformin dose of 2,550 mg/day, and it risks severe lactic acidosis.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **850 mg three times daily with meals**, which is 2,550 mg/day total.\n- **2550 mg total daily**, split another way. For example, 1,000 mg twice daily is 2,000 mg/day, and 850 mg three times daily is 2,550 mg/day.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do want 2550 mg three times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose."
